1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,305
Guess how many people fit

2
00:00:01,305 --> 00:00:03,100
in your sugar cube.

3
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:04,120
All of them,

4
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,840
because you're mostly...

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,833
nothing.

6
00:00:06,870 --> 00:00:07,869
Every atom in you

7
00:00:07,869 --> 00:00:09,270
is cotton candy.

8
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,439
All fluff...

9
00:00:10,439 --> 00:00:12,100
one tiny speck.

10
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:13,633
Squash out the fluff,

11
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,183
and all eight billion of us

12
00:00:15,183 --> 00:00:16,100
would fit...

13
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:17,887
in one cube.

14
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:18,682
Just you?

15
00:00:18,682 --> 00:00:20,940
A speck too small to see...

16
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,671
that still weighs as much

17
00:00:22,671 --> 00:00:23,823
as you.

18
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,333
Still want sugar?

